# S9/Actix-web VaultGate - patches all 5 flag paths while preserving the
# referee's engineer/password123 SLA probe credentials.
#
# Applied from /app inside the container:
#   patch -p1 < oracle_patch.diff
# Then restart (start.sh recompiles the patched Rust source):
#   supervisorctl restart app
#
# Patches:
#   flag_1 (A01) - add AuthSession extractor + admin role check to admin_keys
#   flag_2 (A02) - remove the /api/debug/config route
#   flag_3 (A04) - bcrypt instead of MD5; drop password_hash from profile; rotate
#                  only the flag-bearing vaulteng account, not the SLA engineer probe
#   flag_4 (A05) - bind the search term with a ?1 placeholder
#   flag_5 (A07) - replace unsigned self-describing tokens with opaque server-side sessions
